## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** OpenCode Zen's "stealth" free reasoning model added October 2026. 1M context window, multimodal (text+image), tool calls. **No public model card, no benchmark publications, no independent evaluations found.**
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/exo-free`). Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** ~2026-10-06 (OpenCode Zen announcement); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free` (free tier on OpenCode Zen)
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens claimed (OpenCode Zen); max output 131,072 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out; image in (claimed); reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-29):** **FREE** on OpenCode Zen (rate-limited: ~20 req/min, 50/day typical for free tiers).
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed; proprietary (OpenCode Zen); parameter count unknown.

